      "updated": 1776365548548,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "igress: data flowing in system \n\nall the data store in db is flowwing in the system\n\n\nper day storage = 120GB\n\nso 120 GB / day \n\n\n120GB  / 100K   =  1.2MB / s",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "igress: data flowing in system \n\nall the data store in db is flowwing in the system\n\n\nper day storage = 120GB\n\nso 120 GB / day \n\n\n120GB  / 100K   =  1.2MB / s",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "HpgGST11z4ZQV5kKmoXIz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -30433.104069700395,
